WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.300
Hey, my name is Emily.

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:04.300
The Simple Body Baking Soda-Free Deodorant

00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:06.000
is the only one I will use.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:06.500
I love it.

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:08.700
There’s no artificial, weird fragrances.

00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:10.400
There’s no aluminum.

00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:11.600
I used this before,

00:00:11.700 --> 00:00:13.000
and I used it through cancer treatment

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:14.600
because they recommend not using aluminum,

00:00:14.600 --> 00:00:15.400
and it worked wonderfully.

00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:16.300
I still use it today.

00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:17.800
I just wanted to throw that out there.
